---
description: npm dependency and lockfile workflow
globs: package.json,package-lock.json,services/**/package.json
alwaysApply: false
---

When adding or updating deps:

1. Edit `package.json`
2. `rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json`
3. `npm install`
4. Commit `package.json` + `package-lock.json`; run format, lint, test

Do not hand-edit `package-lock.json`.
